Troubleshooting Common Issues
Docker Permission Issues
If you encounter Docker permission errors:

# Ensure Docker service is running
sudo systemctl start docker
sudo systemctl enable docker

# Verify Docker group membership
groups $USER

# If docker group is not listed, re-login or use:
newgrp docker
Python Virtual Environment Issues
If virtual environment activation fails:

# Deactivate and recreate the environment
deactivate
rm -rf molecule-env
python3 -m venv molecule-env
source molecule-env/bin/activate
Molecule Test Failures
If Molecule tests fail:

# Check container status
docker ps -a

# View detailed logs
molecule test --debug

# Clean up and retry
molecule destroy
molecule test
Package Installation Issues
If package installations fail:

# Update package cache
sudo apt update

# Install missing dependencies
sudo apt install -y python3-dev build-essential

# Upgrade pip and reinstall packages
pip install --upgrade pip
pip install --force-reinstall molecule[docker]
